{"id":"7ce1b12990ae9469","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-arithmetic-hierarchy.md","title":"Arithmetic Hierarchy","display":"df-arithmetic-hierarchy — Arithmetic Hierarchy","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-arithmetic-hierarchy","aliases":["92-df-arithmetic-hierarchy"],"display":"df-arithmetic-hierarchy — Arithmetic Hierarchy","depends_on":["[[92-df-formula]]","[[92-df-delta0-formula]]","[[92-df-signature]]","[[92-df-logically-equivalent]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-arithmetic-hierarchy"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-arithmetic-hierarchy</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-arithmetic-hierarchy — Arithmetic Hierarchy"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5a1bd470754681a7\" href=\"?note=5a1bd470754681a7\" title=\"92-df-formula\">92-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d754a154b50a9533\" href=\"?note=d754a154b50a9533\" title=\"92-df-delta0-formula\">92-df-delta0-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d666a3e3ee6c8148\" href=\"?note=d666a3e3ee6c8148\" title=\"92-df-signature\">92-df-signature</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b201853606d6de9c\" href=\"?note=b201853606d6de9c\" title=\"92-df-logically-equivalent\">92-df-logically-equivalent</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_0^G\">\\(\\Delta_0^G\\)</span> (bounded-formula class, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d754a154b50a9533\" href=\"?note=d754a154b50a9533\" title=\"92-df-delta0-formula\">92-df-delta0-formula</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Var}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Var}_G\\)</span> (variable-symbol set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d666a3e3ee6c8148\" href=\"?note=d666a3e3ee6c8148\" title=\"92-df-signature\">92-df-signature</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Eqv}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Eqv}_G\\)</span> (logical-equivalence relation, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"b201853606d6de9c\" href=\"?note=b201853606d6de9c\" title=\"92-df-logically-equivalent\">92-df-logically-equivalent</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\Sigma_n^G,\\Pi_n^G,\\Delta_n^G)_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\">\\((\\Sigma_n^G,\\Pi_n^G,\\Delta_n^G)_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\)</span> (definition-target hierarchy)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}arithmetic\\text{-}hierarchy} \\vdash \\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\Sigma_0^G=\\Pi_0^G=\\Delta_0^G,\\\\\n&amp;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\qquad\n\\Sigma_{n+1}^G\\coloneqq\\Bigl\\{\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\ \\Bigm|\\\n\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\,\\exists(x_1,\\ldots,x_k)\\in\\mathrm{Var}_G^k\\,\\exists\\varphi\\in\\Pi_n^G\\;\n\\mathrm{Eqv}_G(\\theta,\\exists x_1\\cdots\\exists x_k\\,\\varphi)\\Bigr\\},\\\\\n&amp;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\qquad\n\\Pi_{n+1}^G\\coloneqq\\Bigl\\{\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\ \\Bigm|\\\n\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\,\\exists(x_1,\\ldots,x_k)\\in\\mathrm{Var}_G^k\\,\\exists\\varphi\\in\\Sigma_n^G\\;\n\\mathrm{Eqv}_G(\\theta,\\forall x_1\\cdots\\forall x_k\\,\\varphi)\\Bigr\\},\\\\\n&amp;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\qquad\n\\Delta_n^G\\coloneqq\\Sigma_n^G\\cap\\Pi_n^G.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}arithmetic\\text{-}hierarchy} \\vdash \\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\Sigma_0^G=\\Pi_0^G=\\Delta_0^G,\\\\\n&amp;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\qquad\n\\Sigma_{n+1}^G\\coloneqq\\Bigl\\{\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\ \\Bigm|\\\n\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\,\\exists(x_1,\\ldots,x_k)\\in\\mathrm{Var}_G^k\\,\\exists\\varphi\\in\\Pi_n^G\\;\n\\mathrm{Eqv}_G(\\theta,\\exists x_1\\cdots\\exists x_k\\,\\varphi)\\Bigr\\},\\\\\n&amp;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\qquad\n\\Pi_{n+1}^G\\coloneqq\\Bigl\\{\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\ \\Bigm|\\\n\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\,\\exists(x_1,\\ldots,x_k)\\in\\mathrm{Var}_G^k\\,\\exists\\varphi\\in\\Sigma_n^G\\;\n\\mathrm{Eqv}_G(\\theta,\\forall x_1\\cdots\\forall x_k\\,\\varphi)\\Bigr\\},\\\\\n&amp;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\qquad\n\\Delta_n^G\\coloneqq\\Sigma_n^G\\cap\\Pi_n^G.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_n\">\\(\\Sigma_n\\)</span> : <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>层<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span>公式（存在量词开头）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_n\">\\(\\Pi_n\\)</span> : <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>层<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi\">\\(\\Pi\\)</span>公式（全称量词开头）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_n\">\\(\\Delta_n\\)</span> : 同时是<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_n\">\\(\\Sigma_n\\)</span>和<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_n\">\\(\\Pi_n\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_n^G,\\Pi_n^G\">\\(\\Sigma_n^G,\\Pi_n^G\\)</span> 按逻辑等价闭包，因而 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_n^G\">\\(\\Delta_n^G\\)</span> 不是两个字面前束语法集合的退化交集</li>\n<li>算术层级对公式按量词复杂性分类</li>\n<li>在证明码关系为 PR 的标准编码下，内部可证性公式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_G(x)\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_G(x)\\)</span> 可取为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma^0_1\">\\(\\Sigma^0_1\\)</span></li>\n<li>内部一致性句 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}_G=\\neg\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\bot_G\\urcorner})\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}_G=\\neg\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\bot_G\\urcorner})\\)</span> 可取为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi^0_1\">\\(\\Pi^0_1\\)</span>；外部元语言谓词 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}(G)\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\)</span> 不属于对象语言公式层级</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"5a1bd470754681a7","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-delta0-formula","status":"resolved","id":"d754a154b50a9533","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-delta0-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-signature","status":"resolved","id":"d666a3e3ee6c8148","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-signature]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-logically-equivalent","status":"resolved","id":"b201853606d6de9c","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-logically-equivalent]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-delta0-formula","status":"resolved","id":"d754a154b50a9533","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Delta_0^G$ (bounded-formula class, see [[92-df-delta0-formula]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-signature","status":"resolved","id":"d666a3e3ee6c8148","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Var}_G$ (variable-symbol set, see [[92-df-signature]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-logically-equivalent","status":"resolved","id":"b201853606d6de9c","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Eqv}_G$ (logical-equivale